        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Going forward, we intend to focus on selling our new suite of Shield Annuity products, along with variable annuities with GMWBs and GMDBs only.",
        "start_character": 19783,
        "end_character": 19926
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001685040-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001685040-26-000011-66865f6eb1c6e8d1",
        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are one of the largest providers of annuity and life insurance products in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 342,
        "end_character": 428
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001685040-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001685040-26-000011-66865f6eb1c6e8d1",
        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that by building such a workplace, we are better able to attract and retain talent and provide valuable products that meet the needs of our distribution partners and the financial professionals who sell our products, as well as their clients.",
        "start_character": 124665,
        "end_character": 124918
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001685040-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001685040-26-000011-66865f6eb1c6e8d1",
        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we are a financially disciplined company with an emphasis on independent distribution and that our strategy of offering a targeted set of products to serve our customers and distribution partners will enhance our ability to invest in our business and distribute cash to our shareholders over time.",
        "start_character": 933,
        "end_character": 1241
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001685040-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001685040-26-000011-66865f6eb1c6e8d1",
        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we have the underwriting approach, product design capabilities and distribution relationships that allows us to offer new products that meet our risk-adjusted return objectives and that such capabilities will enhance our ability to maintain market presence and relevance over the long-term.",
        "start_character": 5536,
        "end_character": 5837
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001685040-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001685040-26-000011-66865f6eb1c6e8d1",
        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to meet our risk management objectives by continuing to hedge significant market risks associated with our existing annuity products, as well as new business.",
        "start_character": 5838,
        "end_character": 6006
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001685040-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001685040-26-000011-66865f6eb1c6e8d1",
        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We remain focused on maintaining our strong capital base and excess liquidity at the holding company, and we have established a risk management approach that seeks to mitigate the effects of severe market disruptions and other economic events on our business.",
        "start_character": 2049,
        "end_character": 2308
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001685040-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001685040-26-000011-66865f6eb1c6e8d1",
        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While our in-force book reflects a broad range of life products, we are currently focused on universal life products with index-linked benefits, concentrating on design and profitability over volume.",
        "start_character": 32882,
        "end_character": 33081
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001685040-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001685040-26-000011-66865f6eb1c6e8d1",
        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "that we consider important in the marketing of our products and services, including for our name, “Brighthouse Financial,” our logo design and taglines.",
        "start_character": 129145,
        "end_character": 129297
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001685040-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001685040-26-000011-66865f6eb1c6e8d1",
        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "An insurer issuing a new policy that is backed by its general account and is issued to or for an employee benefit plan after December 31, 1998 is generally subject to fiduciary obligations under ERISA, unless the policy is an insurance policy or contract that provides for benefits the amount of which is guaranteed by the insurer (a “guaranteed benefit policy”), in which case, the assets would not be considered “plan assets.” We have taken and continue to take steps designed to ensure that policies issued to ERISA Plans after 1998 qualify as guaranteed benefit policies.",
        "start_character": 97631,
        "end_character": 98206
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001685040-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001685040-26-000011-66865f6eb1c6e8d1",
        "accession_number": "0001685040-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "DOL regulations issued thereafter provide that, if an insurer satisfies certain requirements, assets supporting a policy backed by the insurer’s general account and issued before 1999 will not constitute “plan assets.” We have taken and continue to take steps designed to ensure compliance with these regulations.",
        "start_character": 97317,
        "end_character": 97630
      }
    ]
